1
00:00:00,575 --> 00:00:04,275
(Sheldon:)It says here that
up to 80% of new mothers

2
00:00:04,279 --> 00:00:05,949
(Sheldon:)experience baby blues.

3
00:00:05,947 --> 00:00:07,577
(Leonard:)And that
the best thing to do

4
00:00:07,582 --> 00:00:10,252
(Sheldon:)is reassure them that
they're doing a good job.

5
00:00:10,252 --> 00:00:11,222
(Penny(checking phone):)Bernadette,

6
00:00:11,219 --> 00:00:15,519
(Sheldon:)you are doing
a good job.

7
00:00:15,524 --> 00:00:18,854
(Bernadette:)Thank you, Sheldon,
I'm feeling better now.

8
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,460
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Internet.

9
00:00:20,462 --> 00:00:22,162
(Sheldon:)I'm telling you,
with the right YouTube video,

10
00:00:22,164 --> 00:00:24,834
(Sheldon:)I can give Howard
a vasectomy.

11
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:29,432
(Penny:)So things started
to turn around?

12
00:00:29,438 --> 00:00:32,838
(Bernadette:)Yeah, eventually I figured out
how to get the baby to sleep.

13
00:00:32,841 --> 00:00:36,511
(Leonard:)Please tell me you didn't use
Amy's magic juice.

14
00:00:44,319 --> 00:00:46,049
- Bernie?
- Shh.

15
00:00:46,054 --> 00:00:47,124
(Bernadette:)She's asleep.

